"Hi {customer_firstname},\n"
"\n"
"Just a friendly reminder that we will be automatically charging the payment method we have on file for <strong>{order_amount}</strong> on <strong>{next_bill_date}</strong>.\n"
"\n"
"If you have any questions regarding your upcoming payment, please don't hesitate to get in touch.\n"
"\n"
"Thank you,\n"
"{site_name}"
msgstr ""
"Bonjour {customer_firstname},\n"
"\n"
"Juste un petit rappel amical que nous allons facturer automatiquement le mode de paiement que nous avons en fichier pour <strong>{order_amount}</strong> le <strong>{next_bill_date}</strong>.\n"
"\n"
"Si vous avez des questions concernant votre paiement à venir, n'hésitez pas à nous contacter.\n"
"\n"
"Merci,\n"
"{site_name}"

